  "final_message": "Done. Built on the existing scaffold.\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`): Flask + SQLite (`./data/quiz.sqlite3`), 24 seeded questions, bearer-token auth, admin from `ADMIN_PASSWORD` (disabled when unset), all `/api` endpoints, validation, ownership checks, SPA frontend serving.\n\n**Frontend** (`frontend/src/`): React/TS + Tailwind v4 via `@tailwindcss/vite`; auth, one-question-at-a-time quiz with progress, scored review, history, and admin add/list forms. Build runs `tsc --noEmit && vite build`.\n\nVerified: typecheck, build (utilities present in CSS), `npm ci`, full API smoke tests, admin-disable, restart persistence, and real gunicorn with 2 workers. Also fixed the broken `requirements.lock` (hashes forced `--require-hashes`, rejecting Flask's unpinned deps) and added `.gitignore`.\n\nOne note: `score` is the number of correct answers (integer), matching `correct`.",
